{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "942e8d44-009d-527c-8783-27656520b8de", "source_ordinal": 2781, "reading_ordinal": 1272, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "诛心病", "published_at": "2022-05-27T14:37:51+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/534646046/answer/2503912556"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "挺有道理的啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "第一，提供了新信息。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "第二，对于事情本身的看法出自他根据自己经验的推测。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这对你形成更好的看法有正面价值。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你可以看过他提供的信息后决定这不足以改变你的个人判断，但对这个搞诛心属于很不健康的心态。", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 106}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "因为这样去口诛笔伐给出的信息不合你意的人，对于你自己获得最多的参考信息严重不利。", "char_start": 107, "char_end": 147}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "别人没有义务要保证提供的信息合你的意，只有道义上的义务保证自己说的是ta自己相信的事实，并且把事实描述和推测做区分。", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 206}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这两点他都做到了，已经满足了发言的必要责任，已经构成了正面贡献，已经应该得到感谢。", "char_start": 207, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你认为他的推测是错的，并不足以构成“故意尝试误导”的罪名。", "char_start": 249, "char_end": 278}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这样想问题的人，你自己换一个角度想想——你敢跟ta打交道吗？", "char_start": 279, "char_end": 309}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不要做一个连你自己也不敢打交道的人。", "char_start": 310, "char_end": 328}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这道理很朴素。", "char_start": 329, "char_end": 336}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "附加一条——", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "越是软弱的人，越好诛心。", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 357}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这类人很容易因为极小的事——有时甚至还是对ta的好意——而对人衔恨在心。", "char_start": 358, "char_end": 394}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "还不是普通的恨，是要碎尸万段、打入地狱的那种恨。", "char_start": 395, "char_end": 419}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "其实根本原因很简单——ta们太脆弱了，再经不起任何风吹草动，所以任何响动都忍不住要想象成最恶劣的可能，生怕再把任何一种恶意误以为无事甚至好意而受哪怕任何一种新的伤害。", "char_start": 420, "char_end": 503}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而另一方面，如果ta们按捺不住的呼喊被其他同类听到，很容易会引发链式反应，彼此呼应起来，这会造成一种“我们有很多人”的安慰感。", "char_start": 504, "char_end": 567}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这整个过程很类似系统电路有设计缺陷造成的正反馈放大，就像你不小心把麦克风和音箱对在一起，然后轻轻一敲就发生啸叫一样。", "char_start": 568, "char_end": 626}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这种现象也是古代军营常发生的“营啸”的机制根源。", "char_start": 627, "char_end": 651}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "如何去控制社会的总体焦虑水平，降低这种社会情绪风暴的发生概率和控制它的破坏性，这显然就是一个会被经验丰富的管理者高度关注的问题。", "char_start": 652, "char_end": 716}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这里只客观的给予两条建议——", "char_start": 717, "char_end": 731}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "1）检查自己的焦虑水平。你如果对此感到过度气愤，乃至于对乌合麒麟这种发言都感到不可遏制的报复欲，你要立刻警惕自己的精神状态。", "char_start": 732, "char_end": 794}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你必须要增加锻炼时间和休息时间，并且你必须要整理你自己的信息源了。", "char_start": 795, "char_end": 828}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "不管你认为自己的关注列表如何健康，你的具体表现也已经从事实面证实了它仍然对你负面影响太大。你要迅速的取关甚至屏蔽一些继续煽动你危机感的信源。", "char_start": 829, "char_end": 899}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "否则这些危机还未必能把你怎样，这些被“宁可信其有”激发的危机感本身就能刺激你做出重大的错误决策，事后回想你都会觉得不可思议。", "char_start": 900, "char_end": 962}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这种高焦虑水平还会全面的破坏你的一切社会关系，使得所有人都自觉或不自觉地回避与你接触。而这种“隔了几个月才发现好像和谁都很久没见了”的问题可以迅速的让你陷入人生低谷。", "char_start": 963, "char_end": 1046}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "什么俄乌问题、社会景气问题、网军阴谋问题，对你来说远没有这种外露的负面心理状态对你的直接伤害紧急、后果也远没有它严重。", "char_start": 1047, "char_end": 1106}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "事实上，这本身正是认知战要达到的目标之一——扭曲你的认识其实只是理想目标，第一目标是要目标社会陷入高焦虑状态，为孕育各种反理性的下意识风暴创造理想环境。", "char_start": 1107, "char_end": 1183}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "不必让你改变立场和思想，仅仅把你刺激到一触即跳、上纲上线，它们已经获得了成功了。", "char_start": 1184, "char_end": 1224}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "不要当ta们的受害者，更不要既当ta们的受害者，还要当ta们的帮凶。", "char_start": 1225, "char_end": 1259}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "为虎作伥的故事好好的看一看。", "char_start": 1260, "char_end": 1274}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "2）仅仅从避祸的角度看，也建议你管理自己的情绪，不要充当扩散放大这些带有恶意诛心信息的传播和放大节点。", "char_start": 1276, "char_end": 1327}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "因为极易导致定向处理，让你的社交身份给这些鬼东西陪葬。", "char_start": 1328, "char_end": 1355}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "不要喊什么“打压言论”，因为这是国家安全事项，没有什么可商量的余地。", "char_start": 1356, "char_end": 1390}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "更不必说，这类成事不足、败事有余的焦虑发作，并没有什么言论的价值。", "char_start": 1391, "char_end": 1424}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 38}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0203"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价乌合麒麟关于“吴勇工作室绘画的人教社教材”的发言？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036"], "summary": "围绕“诛心病”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“挺有道理的啊。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "挺有道理的啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2e34cdf2-7f92-5fab-b642-c65aa1ddbc4e", "source_ordinal": 2780, "reading_ordinal": 1273, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "职业介绍", "published_at": "2022-05-27T16:15:47+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/534601991/answer/2504075607"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "总裁——在家健身，种菜", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "常务副总裁——帮朋友打打杂", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "职业投资人——东看看西看看，到处听故事", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "销售总监——帮朋友跑腿看摊子", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "技术总监——帮朋友临时顶一顶缸 / 在家做玩具", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "战略策划和顾问——陪人喝喝茶、聊聊天", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "艺术家——在家闭门造车", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "思想家——主业种树，副业撸猫", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "以下类推。", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 137}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0203"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：面对问询职业，不想告诉对方，也不想表述太模糊导致对方追问，只想保持起码的礼貌，该怎样回复为好？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“职业介绍”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“总裁——在家健身，种菜”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "总裁——在家健身，种菜", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b4ecba65-1b4f-55af-82c1-7052cbe399bb", "source_ordinal": 2779, "reading_ordinal": 1274, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "常见猥琐原因", "published_at": "2022-05-27T18:31:54+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/277246072/answer/2504282039"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "1）阴阳怪气。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "2）阴阳怪气。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "3）阴阳怪气。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "4）阴阳怪气。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "5）阴阳怪气。", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 39}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "…", "char_start": 40, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "…", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "…\n\n…", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "3927）阴阳怪气。\n3928）吸毒。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 67}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "…", "char_start": 68, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "3927）阴阳怪气。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "3928）吸毒。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 67}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "…", "char_start": 68, "char_end": 69}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 2}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_has_content_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "body", "char_start": 42, "sample": "…"}, {"reason": "text_has_content_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "body", "char_start": 48, "sample": "3927）阴阳怪气。\n3928）吸毒。"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0203"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：经常做什么会让一个人的气质变猥琐？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“常见猥琐原因”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“1）阴阳怪气。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "1）阴阳怪气。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "11273ac5-c1a7-5414-b1ff-20cec8b2396b", "source_ordinal": 2778, "reading_ordinal": 1275, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "头顶那个洞", "published_at": "2022-05-27T19:35:56+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/22952968/answer/2504352832"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有一点要纠正一下——穹顶的孔洞是有意为之，而不是“因为没能力合拢所以没办法，只能留个洞”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "道理很简单——真不想留，减小穹顶跨度就是了。", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "减小二十米，什么洞都合得上。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "事实上万神庙的思路恐怕是反的——先往大了造，然后尽量往中间一层层的施工。最初并不知道洞会有多大，只知道肯定要留洞。这个洞实际上可大可小，做到最后一层，再根据实际情况、实际测试来决定确切尺寸。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "何以见得呢？", "char_start": 180, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "因为是不是预知会留洞是可以从地基工程里看出来的。提前就打算好了要留洞，不光是地面要做排水，地基本身也要做防渗水泡水的处理。", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "否则几千年的大雨小雨，地基下层土层吸水过多发生不稳定的话，整栋建筑都会倒塌。而这个地基的防渗防泡处理是一开始就要先做的。", "char_start": 249, "char_end": 309}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "如果你提前不预先做好地基的防水处理，房子都造完了，到了发现顶封不上再来搞地基，这从什么角度看都可以判刑了。", "char_start": 310, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "它必须被提前规划，所以设计师必然一开始就知道穹顶会留一个洞。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 394}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "只是最多因为没有可靠的数学工具进行有效的工程计算，而无法确知准确的大小罢了。", "char_start": 395, "char_end": 433}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "所以这更可能是一个设计，而不太可能是一个bug。", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而既然知道这是设计，设计的意图也就很显然了。", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这个要从窗户说起。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 491}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这个穹顶对支撑墙体有巨大的侧向推力。这个推力主要靠墙自己的稳定性来抵消。", "char_start": 492, "char_end": 528}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "为了保证这些墙体的稳定，这些墙必须做得又重又厚。", "char_start": 529, "char_end": 553}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "很自然的，也不能在这些承重墙上开太多窗。", "char_start": 554, "char_end": 574}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这必然导致开窗很小。", "char_start": 575, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "厚墙上开小窗，宽两尺、高四尺的窗子，窗洞深度也是两尺，你觉得它透光吗？", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 621}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "圣米歇尔堡，注意它的窗户大小", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 637}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "欧洲直到中世纪发明飞扶壁结构之前，长期依靠墙来承重，承重墙上的窗子一般都小得要命。", "char_start": 638, "char_end": 679}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "直到发明了飞扶壁，靠着大量的侧面支撑顶住屋顶对墙壁的外推，墙才可以做的轻薄，才敢于开大窗，才解决了大跨度空间的采光问题。", "char_start": 680, "char_end": 740}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "大量使用飞扶壁的巴黎圣母院，窗户尺寸明显增大，几至极限。", "char_start": 742, "char_end": 770}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "如果穹顶再不开那个圆洞，万神庙内会暗到走路撞人。", "char_start": 771, "char_end": 795}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "那么大的闭塞空间，别说点蜡烛照不亮，就是点篝火可能都一片昏暗。", "char_start": 796, "char_end": 827}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "所以这个洞不是技术不行的结果。", "char_start": 828, "char_end": 843}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这是有意的设计。", "char_start": 844, "char_end": 852}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-05/27/0ae470fcb5d0f718b836d9f4a69cd26e.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-05/27/91956376878996e3ebdb6b1b984313be.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 32, "image": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0203"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：像罗马万神庙这样的顶部敞开式建筑，下雨时怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“头顶那个洞”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有一点要纠正一下——穹顶的孔洞是有意为之，而不是“因为没能力合拢所以没办法，只能留个洞”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有一点要纠正一下——穹顶的孔洞是有意为之，而不是“因为没能力合拢所以没办法，只能留个洞”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 45, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "00790ebd-8a17-533e-9185-6853b69db4d0", "source_ordinal": 2777, "reading_ordinal": 1276, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "123和321", "published_at": "2022-05-28T19:54:40+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/534619409/answer/2505651300"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "粮食吃没了，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "有的人首先考虑要杀谁，", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "有的人首先考虑晚上这顿上哪吃，", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "有的人首先考虑怎么尽量避免这事再次发生。", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这三个问题，优先级排序不同，考虑问题的思路和方式是完全不同的。", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你应该考虑一下，你要怎么排。", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这不是个政论问题，而是一个方法论问题，进而是一个人生选择问题。", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你青睐什么方法，你就会走入什么样的人生。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 155}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0203"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待“人教版数学教材插图引争议”？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“123和321”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“粮食吃没了，”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "粮食吃没了，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d2ec8527-5248-5c7b-87c4-81ab4b4a7e14", "source_ordinal": 2776, "reading_ordinal": 1277, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "战争罪", "published_at": "2022-05-29T00:22:43+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/529444185/answer/2505947733"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这取决于他是否与一些战争罪行有关。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "包括但不限于：", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "是否有下令、或批准、或明知而不禁止绑架平民做人肉盾牌。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "是否有下令、或批准、或明知而不禁止攻击俄罗斯境内的平民。", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "是否下令、或批准、或明知而不禁止在不疏散民众的前提下炸毁堤坝。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "是否下令、或批准、或明知而不禁止对自己的平民发射导弹、炮弹进行轰炸。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 149}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "是否下令、或批准、或明知而不禁止在自己的平民区布设地雷。", "char_start": 150, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "是否下令、或批准、或明知而不禁止不经审判就以通敌罪名处决自己的平民——或外交官。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "是否有下令、或批准、或明知而不禁止军队在居民区、学校、医院布防。", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 252}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "是否有下令、或批准、或明知而不禁止虐待战俘。", "char_start": 253, "char_end": 275}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "是否有下令、或批准、或明知而不禁止强征未成年人入伍。", "char_start": 276, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "是否有下令、或批准、或明知而不禁止对军人使用毒品和系统使用精神类药物。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 338}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "是否有下令、或批准、或明知而不禁止攻击核电站或尝试制造核污染危机。", "char_start": 339, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "是否涉嫌向议会故意隐瞒、或提供错误信息，误导议会作出错误的战争判断。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "他如果战败被俘，站上了审判席，上面这些罪名全都能摆脱的概率恐怕不乐观。", "char_start": 409, "char_end": 444}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "接近于0。", "char_start": 446, "char_end": 451}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "PS：", "char_start": 453, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这个问题一点也不荒谬。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 468}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "觉得它荒谬，反而有些荒谬。", "char_start": 469, "char_end": 482}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0203"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：泽连斯基应不应该被定义为“战犯”？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“战争罪”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这取决于他是否与一些战争罪行有关。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这取决于他是否与一些战争罪行有关。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f88de7f7-215f-5177-aa9f-3285a202afa2", "source_ordinal": 2775, "reading_ordinal": 1278, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "岂甘人后", "published_at": "2022-05-29T02:25:51+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/533509957/answer/2506021968"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "高祖常繇咸阳，纵观，观秦皇帝，喟然太息曰：「嗟乎，大丈夫当如是也！」", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "quote", "index": 2, "text": "秦始皇帝游会稽，渡浙江，梁与籍俱观。籍曰：“彼可取而代也。”", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 66}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "quote", "index": 3, "text": "陈胜佐之，并杀两尉。召令徒属曰：“公等遇雨，皆已失期，失期当斩。藉第令毋斩，而戍死者固十六七。且壮士不死即已，死即举大名耳，王侯将相宁有种乎！”徒属皆曰：“敬受命。”", "char_start": 68, "char_end": 151}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不甘于人后，是中国人天生的民族性格、默认设置。", "char_start": 152, "char_end": 175}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "凡说汉语者，皆不可免。", "char_start": 176, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "美国人要获得安全感，靠的是武力天下第一。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 209}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "只要我武力天下第一，其它的东西不是天下第一，不怕你不妥协供奉。", "char_start": 210, "char_end": 241}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "和武力（包括软武力）无关的项，美国可以接受自己不是第一。", "char_start": 242, "char_end": 270}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "比如它就不在乎法国的葡萄酒和意大利的西服比自己做得好。", "char_start": 271, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "中国要获得安全感，靠的是一切都要天下第一。", "char_start": 300, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "任何项目不是第一，都一定处在追赶第一的不懈努力中。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "已经是第一，也要说服自己这只是侥幸，要居安思危。", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "只要是人可以努力的事项，哪怕是酿葡萄酒也要第一，做西服都要第一。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "我们根本就没有考虑过“甘于第二”的可行性和合理性。", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我们也讲“淡泊明志”，但是淡泊明志是为了消除干扰，好集中精力在专注的事业上力争第一。", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 474}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我们也讲一张一弛，文武之道。但是你放心，一张绝不是为了让你一弛，一弛只会是为了一张。", "char_start": 475, "char_end": 517}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "就算是当和尚，当到时时勤拂拭，莫使惹尘埃了。", "char_start": 519, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "那我也要菩提本无树，拆了你的鸟台，", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 559}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "老子禅宗第一空。", "char_start": 560, "char_end": 568}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "在你怨恨这种民族性给你带来痛苦的时候，记住这个事实——", "char_start": 570, "char_end": 597}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "如果不是这样，你根本不会存在。", "char_start": 598, "char_end": 613}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 3, "paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0203"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么父母不让我躺平，总说看看别人为什么一直学习，为什么人活着一定要跟别人比，一定要吃苦?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“岂甘人后”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“高祖常繇咸阳，纵观，观秦皇帝，喟然太息曰：「嗟乎，大丈夫当如是也！」”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "高祖常繇咸阳，纵观，观秦皇帝，喟然太息曰：「嗟乎，大丈夫当如是也！」", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 34, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "78d79236-1242-5ce9-8747-adfb63093a92", "source_ordinal": 2774, "reading_ordinal": 1279, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "百万基站", "published_at": "2022-05-30T15:40:36+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/534849304/answer/2508029333"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "没必要评价。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "世界上自作聪明跟风站在历史错误的一边的人多了，这只是常态而已。", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "现在四十多岁的人，普遍在2000年互联网大潮起来时都是二十岁出头，又有几个成了马云刘强东呢？", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "成不了马云刘强东的才是常态。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "也不必替ta们担忧，ta们押错了宝也不会怎样，时代的风吹过来了，ta们自然会顺风转舵。ta们从来不会考虑“领先时代”的竞争模式，所以也根本不会因此冒多大的风险。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "ta们只是会一直安安全全的羡慕风口上的猪而已。", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 205}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但不当风口上的猪，也自有一份安全福利，不是吗？", "char_start": 206, "char_end": 229}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "5G建设的效能还没有完全的发挥出来，这跟骨干网建设、能源布局的同步推进受到疫情和中美大战的影响有关系。", "char_start": 230, "char_end": 281}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "但这根本不代表“5G技术踏空”。", "char_start": 282, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "耐心等待就是了。骨干网和再生能源建设这两块二期配套工程要搞起来，5G网络才会真正展露应有的能力。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "至于有些人对这个工程节点冷潮热讽的，其实是没有常识。", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 374}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "很显然移动分到的指标任务就不止这么多，它所谓的献礼只是打算提前完成本就规划好的的任务里程碑而已，根本不是“为了献礼额外追加不必要的基站数量”。", "char_start": 375, "char_end": 446}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0203"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：中国移动已经提出“确保在党的二十大前5G基站总数超100万个”，如何评价之前挖苦讽刺华为5G的人？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“百万基站”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“没必要评价。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "没必要评价。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
